        "comments": "The assembly bLarGla1.hap2.1 is based on 72x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds are named by synteny based on bLarArg3.hap1.1 - GCA_964417175.1. This assembly shows uncertainty in the orientation of the centromeric region on scaffold?SUPER_6 (10,000?15,600?kbp): the Hi?C contact map suggests that haplotype?2 may be oriented differently from haplotype?1 in this region.",
